The audit is still within the expected runtime for eight independent 500,000-node searches. The verifier itself remains cheap—231 exact edge checks for a shipping witness—and the planted set is optimum because the auxiliary graph is 22-partite, so its clique number cannot exceed the 22-vertex clique constructed in advance.
