The bare `easy` rung was solved by two of three oracles, so the harness correctly escalated to `medium` (\(p=500{,}009\)). This is useful evidence: the invariant is discoverable at the first rung, and shipping will move only if a higher rung holds without exceeding the fixed 22-entry answer or 199-operation route.
