codex
All three oracles solved the first escalated rung as well. The evidence now points to a likely `budget_bound` outcome: scaling the modulus raises the mechanical scan but not the conceptual cocycle, so capable no-tool models keep using the intended compression. I’m preserving that result rather than obscuring the invariant or changing axes mid-run.
