-
-## Oracle loop and G9 arms
-
-The bare harness returned `budget_bound`, not `hardened`: at least one oracle solved every rung through all six allowed escalations, while `escalate()` could still move from `p=16,000,289` to `p=32,000,603` with the same 22-atom witness. The family is therefore parked, not rejected and not ready to emit. The active environment overrode the documented four-vendor pool with two models, another reason not to treat this as release evidence.
