+Generation is inverse. It samples the transversal and three global field roots first, builds every pair relation around them, and retains only instances with a unique public cocycle branch. The exceptional affine relation leaves exactly the three sampled roots, so there are exactly three valid witnesses. The answer is never obtained by solving the finished instance.
 
